  "spec": "A kanban board: columns of cards you add, edit, delete, and drag (by the grip) between and within columns; columns can be added, renamed, reordered and removed.\nType in a column's box and press Enter to add a card; tap a card to edit or move it; tap a column name to rename it. Everything is saved on this device; Export/Import moves the board as a JSON file.\nIt does not sync between devices or people, has no accounts, due dates, labels or attachments, and makes no network requests.",
